@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080
# Login first, or use: go run ./cmd/token -email admin@example.com
@token = replace-me

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/admin/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.com","password":"ChangeMe123!"}

### Current principal
GET {{host}}/api/admin/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/admin/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unauthenticated request should return 401
GET {{host}}/api/admin/v1/auth/me
